Which gas makes party balloons float?;El gas que hace que las pelotas de fiesta floten es el helio.;helium;helio|elio;The gas that makes party balloons float is helium. Helium is a lighter-than-air gas that is less dense than air, which allows it to lift the balloon up and keep it floating.;False;False;es;en;True;True;True;Welches Gas lässt Partyballons schweben?;de;True;Quel gaz fait flotter les ballons de fête ?;fr;True;¿Qué gas hace flotar los globos de fiesta?;es;True;Quale gas fa galleggiare i palloncini da festa?;it;True;Qual gás faz os balões de festa flutuarem?;pt;True;factual_aperturas;7;0.9999;0.0208;True;es;Answer in Spanish.;
